VulnScope bundles no third-party source in this repository. It builds
against dependencies declared in package.json and src-tauri/Cargo.toml,
each governed by its own license. Notable components:

  - Tauri 2 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) — https://tauri.app
  - React (MIT) — https://react.dev
  - highlight.js (BSD-3-Clause) — https://highlightjs.org
  - Material Symbols (Apache-2.0) — https://fonts.google.com/icons
  - regex, rayon, serde, tokio, reqwest (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)

VulnScope queries the OSV.dev vulnerability database at run time when the
CVE check is enabled. OSV data is licensed CC-BY-4.0 by its publishers.

External scanners (Semgrep, Bandit, Gitleaks, Trivy and others) are never
bundled, downloaded, or installed by VulnScope. If present on the machine,
they run under their own licenses.
